Cell["\<\
The evolution graph shows states in blue and events in yellow. With events \
distinct, each class at two steps has one event vertex for each application \
reaching it:\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->403125484,ExpressionUUID->"30209679-023a-ee91-61df-0823b7ccb4fb"],

