Cell["\<\
With a list of rules, every rule is applied at every state, and each event \
records the index of its rule, counted from 0. Two rules that extend an edge \
by one edge and by two:\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1256596424,ExpressionUUID->"6804c0ab-fd16-b7db-183b-d9f4f4a01d21"],

